   or CC BY 4.0.
   https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts

2. JetBrains Mono Nerd Font (JetBrainsMonoNLNerdFont-*.woff2)
   Copyright (c) 2020, JetBrains Mono Project Authors
   Base font licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (OFL-1.1).
   Appended icon glyphs licensed under the MIT License (Nerd Fonts project).
   https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono
   https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts

3. Nerd Font SVG Icons (10.403 icons, generated from SymbolsNerdFont-Regular.ttf)
   Generated at build time using ttf-parser. Derived from the Nerd Fonts
   project (see item 1 above) for glyph data.
   https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts
